    <VALUE Lang="tw">300 Crescent Moon Pieces = Choose one of Crescent Moon Random Box 2 or 3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">400 Crescent Moon Pieces = Crescent Moon Random Box 4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">一定要幫我找回來唷！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_harvestmooneven_01.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">將250個Crescent Moon Pieces 兌換成 Crescent Moon Random Box 1.</VALUE>
