    <VALUE Lang="tw">2. Merry Red Sock 5 =&gt; Mini Christmas Gift Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">3. Merry Red Sock 25 =&gt; Christmas Box</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_santagirl.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">將1個Merry Red Socks交換成Reform Card (2P) Box.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_santagirl.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">將5個Merry Red Socks交換成Mini Christmas Gift Box.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_santagirl.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">將25個Merry Red Socks交換成Christmas Box.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_swordevent01.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">劍道部是最強的！但是比他新出的職業太多了！所以搞得我們好像很弱~ 不過請別失望，我們會讓您看到跟以前不一樣的劍道部！^__^</VALUE>
