    <VALUE Lang="tw">額….嗯….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">重生的Obinine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">犧牲小我，完成大我。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問現況</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">來自Obinine的信息</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">游擊隊的飾品碎片</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">傳遞游擊隊的飾品碎片</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">尋求伸出援手的人</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">通知 Obinine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">叛徒的死期</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">傳遞游擊隊的飾品碎片</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">噢！象徵游擊隊榮耀的飾品碎片也太小了吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">啊！頭好痛！您是誰？又把我叫醒了？我是 Daramaian游擊隊的成員。總之，謝謝您的幫忙唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我是負責協助隊長的游擊隊成員。某個老人對我和隊長進行了實驗，但之後的事情，我都想不起來了。 額…..我甚至想不起那位博士的長相。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">在我昏厥之前，我記得我跟Veno隊長和隊員們一起行動。在這艱難的旅途中，我們遇到了一位很親切的博士。但我現在只記得，他對我們做了一項建議，我卻想不起來內容。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">如果您有看到Veno在這附近，別忘記一定要通知我一聲。, 如果真的找不到他的人，請您至少試著找找看他的蹤跡。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我瞭解了….所以才會那樣子啊~沒得選擇了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">您有個很優秀的團隊，我偉大的隊長Veno….哇嗚！他一定被邪惡的博士折磨到體力變得很差，還有我們的失散弟兄….真的很難過。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我正在尋找可以幫忙找出其他失散的游擊隊成員，並解說情況的那個人。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">叛徒Lucian?! 嗯…..果然不出我所料。您願意幫我一個忙嗎？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Lucian 曾是游擊隊最優秀的戰士。很多敵人都敗在他的倒下。不過，歲月不饒人，他變得有些脆弱。他最近在策劃一件恐怖行動。他希望可以擁有絕對起點的力量。請找到他，給他點教訓，讓他清醒吧，另外，請取回飾品。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">誰是在Control Tower的那位老師呢？嗯…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">設定開始位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">聽聽看那喃喃自語之音</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Nurse Trainee (Dispatched)的請求 II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不可告人的秘密</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">可疑的關係</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">來這裡以前我是愛錢一族。賺錢賺了十幾年終於找到了方法。很多人為了賺錢只注重眼前的利益。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這樣可能會帶來不可避免的情況。想要賺大錢也要有那個本事。與其覬覦其它利益還不如守本分。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">繼續聽取</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">有這種事。你居然不知道我是誰。我是中央控制塔Control Tower和環境控制塔Evironment Control Tower來回奔波的研究員。在事件爆發前我被抓到研究院B1F進行實驗，不過最後逃出來了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">還有一位女生跟我ㄧ起逃走，她說她是學生。她是我的恩人請你幫忙尋找她的下落</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我好像有個哥哥..又好像沒有...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">阿!阿阿! 不知道..啦</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">毀滅.... 那些與大自然背道而馳的人！！！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問她是誰？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">傳達Garansanoa的信息</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">問她會不會痛？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">交付治療的藥</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問現在什麼事情正在發生</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">告訴她結果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問過去發生的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問關於地下室的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">암흑의 목걸이의 부활을 의뢰한다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">在Central Park的 Environment Control Tower下面有地下設備。找到Control Tower周圍的入口，進去就可以尋找朋友了。聽說和我們一起被實驗的生命體遍佈在裡面。要小心！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">음... 이계마나와 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이... 모두 다 있군. 자 그럼 어디 힘을 부활시켜 볼까? 혹시 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이를 차고 있다면 어서 벗게나. 착용을 하고 있으면 힘을 부활시킬 수가 없으니...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">암흑의 목걸이의 힘을 부활시킨다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_11_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">服從Daian....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Garansanoa.. 那位長者.... 尊敬長者的Daian....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">治療方法是.. Paranovan的Orb……一塊Vicious Mind..... 回憶是..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">謝謝您。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">很久以前，TK博士綁架了我們Daramaian祭司。之後，我們被帶到了這裡，他們對我們進行了實驗。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">最後的記憶是，高大長老發出了慘叫聲之後，還變成了怪異的生物。我一定要報仇！對那些進行實驗的研究人員。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">從您身上能聞出他們的痛苦。謝謝了！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Daramai是各部族聚集的社會。Garansanoa是我們炎魔族的長老。他要找的人一定是背負重要任務的人。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問她是否知道他們的蹤跡</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">在和Lagia的戰鬥中被抓來這個地方，我什麼都不知道…對不起…有知道任何消息一定會馬上告訴Garansanoa。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">顧客就是王...哈哈哈</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">啟動物品組合機</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">物品交易</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問關於物品組合機</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問關於物品組合機</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">告訴他你希望製作基礎物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">問問看他是誰？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">呵呵..我無法告訴你太詳細的東西。要製作特定的物品就需要相對應的材料。 只要將材料放入物品組合機就可以獲得非常實用的物品。當然，這實用的定義是因人而異的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">關於基礎物品…讓我來告訴您製作Fermented Recovery Potion的方法。從Merchant買一個麵包，並從我這裡買一罐Liquid Fermentation Potion就可以透過我來調製了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回首頁。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">給我看所需的材料內容，並告訴我您想用物品組合機就行了。切記，要正確地控制每項材料的數量喲。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">呵呵，您是誰？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">好久沒見到人類了。有什麼問題，請儘管來找我。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">告訴他，是Garansanoa派您來的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">告訴他，您有保護那些研究員。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">是身穿黑色衣服令人厭煩的傢伙派你過來的吧.，他跟我說要給靈珠的但我沒辦法幫助你，需要有學生來幫忙.幫我處理研究員因為我晚上想好好睡覺</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">哦!!你真厲害.現在想好好睡一覺了.為了謝謝你那我就把身穿黑衣服的朋友那裡拿到的靈珠給你吧.雖然我也不知道有沒有用處</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">歡迎大家來到這裡。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問dispatched Extra Activity Teacher</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Partisan的主要成員</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">製作Aspirin I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">製作Aspirin III</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">重生的Obinine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">隕石紀念碑的秘密 I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_15">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">隕石紀念碑的秘密 I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_16">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">隕石紀念碑的秘密 II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
