  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">怎麼還沒完成學院註冊呢？是因為學校的服務不夠完善嗎？去Welfare Society那邊繳交註冊單，並前往Administration Office，那邊的Student Director先生會批准您的外出申請單的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">一開始，這些任務對我來說真的是比登天還難，而現在，要完成它們，仍是需要擠盡我吃奶的力氣，非常的難。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">嗯，您的學院註冊差不多完成了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">接下來是申請外出。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">現在，在給申請書之前，有件事要先確認好。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">您只要將申請書交給位在School Administration Offic的Student Director 先生就可以外出了。寫好就交給他吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
