  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Nurse的請求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">中毒後體力會持續下降，比燒灼時減少的量更大，請特別注意！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">瞬間行動會不良，不過一般來說持續時間不長。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">話雖如此, 這也算危險的狀況。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">雖然藥品不夠, 不過還是可以幫上小忙, 把受傷的地方給我看</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問傷口治療</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_12_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問現況</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_12_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問異常疾病</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_12_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">嗯.. 你在登記嗎?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不是第一次了吧,哪會有人這麼僵硬的??</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">瞭解嗎</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">可以確實治療到等級15為止, 所以受傷的話趕快到這裡來.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">如果將位置變更為從這裡開始不是更方便嗎</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不管再怎樣累人還是有很多文件要寫跟做很多的事, 但不知何時紙全用光了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">那裡的Welfare Society有, 請問你願意幫我帶過來嗎</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">啊 真是多謝!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">剛剛急急忙忙寫下的東西得再寫一次了呢</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">以後受傷的話再過來吧</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">會給予你更好的治療</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">喔~ 學生你帶來囉</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這不是守衛大叔你要求的嘛?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不管怎樣, 謝啦!! 正好需要.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">藥品本來是不夠的, 若沒有這類急救藥品的話實在沒法度了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">外面的狀況得快點好轉才是, 真是令人擔心啊!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">藥品供給的狀況不好, 已經緊急到要直接製作使用的地步了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不好意思, 可以幫我收集香煙的煙蒂嗎?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">有兩個叫做Little Hooligan和Hooligan的人常叼著煙！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">上次拜託過，但Little Hooligan抽的煙品質不太好, 無法用作藥品的材料。請幫我取得Hooligan的煙吧！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">如果你幫我收集到20個, 我就換錢給你。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">哇~ 你都收集到啦?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">真是感謝</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">因為往後有陣子可能都得這樣自給自足, 所以有空的話再幫個忙吧.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不只藥品, 醫療用品全都不足</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這樣看來可以用的東西全都要找來準備好</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我剛看了一下是不是有群打著石膏的學生</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">那群學生的口袋裡似乎有滿滿的繃帶</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">雖說打著石膏看起來是很痛啦, 不過這樣浪費繃帶的話對其他學生不好吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">說得好, 把剩下的繃帶拿來...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">補給的狀況不是很好, 所以我才說要分著使用呀!"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">啊 太好了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">那群學生的臉雖然看起有點嚇人, 不過挺聽話的嘛…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">是啊..有耐心慢慢說服的話, 不管是誰都會親切相待的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不管怎麼說, 謝啦, 以後還要麻煩你呢</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">망각의 약?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">함부로 쓰면 안되는 약품인데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">이제까지 조정했던 능력치들을 분배하기 전의 상태로 돌려버리는 약이라는 건 알고 있지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">익혔던 스킬들을 모두 잊어버리게 되고, 대신 영령구슬들로 바꿔주는데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">그래도 그런 약을 먹을거야?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">망각의 약을 사용하겠다고 한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_21_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">스킬과 스탯30개를 초기화하기 위해 망각의 약을 사용하겠다고 한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_21_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">그래...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">벌써 결심해 버렸나 보구나</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">할 수 없지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">그럼 가서 약재를 좀 구해 줄래?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">예전같으면 따로 재료를 구할 필요도 없었겠지만, 지금은 그런 흔한 것들도 함부로 쓸 수 없는 상황이니까...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">자, 자 그렇게 싫은 표정 하지 말고!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">금방 구할 수 있을테니까, 다녀와-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">별로 오래 걸리진 않았지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">쉽게 구할 수 있다고 했잖니-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">그런데 아쉽게도 더이상 약을 만들수가 없어</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">그러게 정해진 날짜 동안에 다 했어야지-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">별로 오래 걸리진 않았지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">쉽게 구할 수 있다고 했잖니-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">자, 여기에 이 알약만 섞으면 완성이야</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">솔직히 쓰레기장에서 구한 재료로 이런 미심쩍은 약을 만들어 먹인다는게 좀 마음에 걸리긴 하지만... 그래도 먹는다는데 어떻게 말리겠니-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">응? 이런 재료로 약을 만든다는 말은 안했던가?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">음...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">이제라도 말 해줬으니까 된거지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">자, 약은 다 만들어졌으니까</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">먹</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">망각의 약?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">함부로 쓰면 안되는 약품인데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">이제까지 조정했던 능력치들을 분배하기 전의 상태로 돌려버리는 약이라는 건 알고 있지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">익혔던 스킬들을 모두 잊어버리게 되고, 대신 영령구슬들로 바꿔주는데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">그래도 그런 약을 먹을거야?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">망각의 약을 사용하겠다고 한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_25_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">剩下的藥品不多, 重傷的我沒辦法醫治了, 不過輕傷我還是可以協助治療</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">話是這樣說, 不過如果學生的等級超過15級以上的話, 我可能就會能力不足,而幫不上忙了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">抱歉我幫不了您。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">與其說是病, 不如說是化學反應讓身體著火, 放電麻痺或是凍僵</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">像石頭般僵硬的狀況也有</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問 Burn 效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問 Paralysis 效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問 Freezing 效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問 Poisoning 效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問 Suffocation 效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這個嘛... 因為我又不能出去, 所以不清楚詳細狀況, 聽從外面回來的老師說, 好像大事不妙了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">全身著火之時, 體力狀態會減弱</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">猶如觸電後所有動作都將變慢</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">身體凍僵, 所有動作都會稍稍遲緩, 且防禦力減低</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">持續太久會有危險, 可以的話最好盡快治療</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_nin.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">噢！您不是尋夜光的忍術部，不好意思，沒辦法幫您。</VALUE>
