  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_80_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">社長用那些奇怪的東西造結界的時候, 還半信半疑, 原來真的有此驚人效果啊!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_80_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_81_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_82_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">剛開始註冊時就已經講過很多次了, 現在外面並非一般市內的面貌, 是你們無法想像的狀況.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">有些才到門口就受傷回到醫護室了, 要怎樣做才可以站出正門?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_82_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_83_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">所以準備了簡單的能力試驗程式.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">正門的終端機將它啟動的話, 就開始提出問題, 要在限制的時間內通過</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_83_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_84_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">그래서 간단한 능력 시험 프로그램을 준비했지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">정문의 단말기를 작동시키면 문제를 제시할테니, 제한시간 내에 통과할 수 있도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_84_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_85_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_86_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不管再怎麼菜, 也不能這樣鬼混, 這就像是去保持已凋謝的花的美麗是沒用的. 像這種程度的考試, 就這麼不安...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">學生們怎麼會知道...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">反正給我好好振作!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_86_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_87_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_88_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">學生們要拿著紙幣去給Mystic Peak的Student Director以學習Suggestion Book。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">也許可以給點主意，但是這紙幣不是普通錢幣之類的，不要中途遺失了！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_88_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_89_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">혹시나 해서 주의 주겠는데, 이 지폐는 돈 나부랭이 같은게 아니니까 중간에 없어지지 않도록 주의해야 해!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_89_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">본래는 소승불교에서 모든 번뇌를 뚫고 이치를 깨달아 열반의 경지에 이른 성자를 가리키는 칭호인데 『나한』 이라고도 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">'아라한' 의 자격을 인정받을 수 있다면 특별한 기운이 서린 무기를 받을 수 있어</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">그러려면 '마루치' 와 '아라한' 의 기서를 찾아야만 하지만 말이야...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">'깨달음의 열쇠' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">'나한의 구슬' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_90_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_91_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">是偽造安神特貨幣的實驗品...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">真的很像是那個, 有點奇怪, 一定要看一下銅板嗎?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_91_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_92_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">.........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_93_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">啊, 不是...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">現在已經沒有必要看內容了, 就把東西分別交給教授們就好.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">去把聖財團本部發出的郵件找出來</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_93_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_94_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">가서 세인트 재단 본부가 발송자로 돼 있는 우편물을 찾아 가면 돼</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_94_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_95_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_96_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我說學生們啊...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">現在我們學院的電腦室沒有辦法自動運行, 只有給意見書就要求認證實在有點困難?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">至少要經過資料的比對之後, 才能夠看出程度</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_96_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_97_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">真要這樣看程度的話, 連緊急處理方案也要寫嗎?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我會再聯絡你們, 去找Mystic Peak學院的Student Director, 拿恢復電腦室的備用磁片來...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">因為很急, 就回復一些必要的設施就好, 然後把資料找一找</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_97_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_98_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">연락은 해 놓을테니까 현암학원의 학생주임님께 가서 전산실 복구용 백업디스크를 좀 받아오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">급한대로 필요한 시설만 복구해서 자료를 찾아보도록 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_98_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_99_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_1_0">
