  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_112_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">已經拜託了財團的專員了?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">好吧…把那帶子也拿到這邊來</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這樣的話…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">那麼,把這帶子拿過去給他。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_112_0_1">
