  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">最後從Financial Group Headquarters那裡送來的Order Book以及消息都到了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">現在由正門外面的 Guard保管著，學生們去把它拿過來吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這個呢,我們學院也需要備用磁片…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">沒辦法吧,要回覆緊急的設施的話,就要馬上繞一圈。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
