    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">集中各地選出的人才,隨著特別教育過程的不同,可說是作育英才的地方~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">依我看來,這次入學的新生並沒有達到一定的水準.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">反正就是一群聞不到一點發展氣味的兔崽子們~</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">那紙幣不是像單純的偽造紙幣,你們要分清楚</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">看清楚將它們收集起來</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">像這些製作精美的紙幣,沒有理由胡亂製造它們</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">分明有什麼目的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">""嗯,數字的話像這種程度就可以了…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這些本質不好的不適合的東西到底可以做什麼,我們先試試看就知道了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">總之,為了讓學生在清掃宿舍的垃圾時,能夠選別出有助於調查的垃圾,所以才需要經過特別處理的掃帚。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">準備掃帚</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_32_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Broom掃帚保管在Locker Room那兒。學生們先去把掃帚拿來，再來講接下來的事。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">你來的正好,我正要找人去打掃宿舍…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_34_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">你收集了​​不少嗎?這些就已經足夠了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">啊, 當然垃圾是越少越好,所以你有空的話就多來幫忙一下吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這個帶子是…?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">難不成裝載著 Leonair Campus的記錄…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">學生們,你們沒看內容吧?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">四周都因為電腦的錯誤而亂七八糟</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">但這些事先都有作準備了…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">你說是拜託警察局的嗎?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">真是奇怪…警察應該會支援財團啊…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">難不成…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">對啊~這又不是什麼需要很多時間的事…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">一定會有幾名那種對一些沒用的小事亂反抗的兔崽子…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這是不論你討厭還是耍固執都需要做的事。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">如果你有好好聽課的話,甚至連問我的必要都沒有…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">但是因為現在周邊的構成要素都變的混亂,平凡的生命體並沒有辦法維持原來的樣子或精神狀態</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">在學院裡面組織要能發揮功用, 而且在現在的情況下, 要提升團結力, 不論是創設組織或是加入,都要盡最大的力積極地去做。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_40_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">創建幫派組織</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_40_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">提升幫派組織的地位</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_40_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">.....4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_41_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這是從很久以前就預知的事情了,但是比預想的時間來的快多了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">因為這個原因,所以要趕快找出事情的原委,盡快將它解決…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">.......5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不久之前我們的學生在大本營大鬧了一架之後，從此就開始發生一些異象了…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">說不定，也許可以從這裡理出一些頭緒。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">有謠言說在這群學院生中有一部分轉向名叫」Green」的勢​​力範圍裡去</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">到底是誰在到處放這種話？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">該不會是Sacred Gate Park 那群不像樣的傢伙吧？！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">.....6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"這其中，Leonair Campus變得奇怪，異象發生的速度比以前快了許多。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"也許只要解決最近Leonair學院的問題，搞不好就能使事態鎮靜下來也說不定…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">但那地方的學生和教師們變成了敵人,當然是不容易解決</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不知該怎麼說,也不知會不會變成最糟的情況,事先有點覺悟比較好.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_47_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">......13</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">即使不是這樣,爆發了以前沒有過的事,程序也比較複雜,我是說一直到電算室Computer Room都變得很怪…。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_49_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">青... 青...並不像是名字一般那麼乾乾淨淨的人.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">從我們學院設立前開始,這附近就是一些流氓們走出來的地盤,現在就成為黑社會的團體了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">像這樣的程序都不做的話,學生也有可能變得危險…哎呀,我好像說太多了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"那麼,我會幫你們處理註冊申請書,把原本帶走,去到社團室的話,給老師們外出申請書</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">把那寫一寫帶過去</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_51_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"雖說不是對學生的實力有所懷疑,但是那些外面的傢伙們已經不是人類了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">!最近不知怎麼搞的,莽撞的跑向醫護室的笨蛋們越來越多,沒有辦法只好想一些替代的方法.這你們知道就好!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_52_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">.....14</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_54_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">어차피 지금은 예정에 없던 사건 때문에 우리 학원뿐만 아니라 다들 일정 정지 상태인 모양이니 손해본다는 생각은 하지 말고 열심히 자습이나 하도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_54_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">짾??</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_55_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">이 사건이 수습되지 않으면 학원 문제가 아니라 이 세상 자체가 없어질지도... 이런! 내가 너무 말이 많았군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_55_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_56_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">하여튼 이 등록신청서는... 보자...정상적인 절차를 거쳐 오지 않았군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">좀 곤란하겠는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_56_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">?쩊홁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_57_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">.......15</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">아마 그 신청서도 매점에 준비해 두고 있을게다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">하지만 다음부터는 제대로 정상적인 절차를 받아 오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_58_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">짾??</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">所謂的規則是必須要遵守的,而並不是只是說說而已,你聽清楚了嗎?!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_59_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Sacred Gate、Mystic Peak、Phoenix、還有Leonair 這4個學院, 因結界形成而設立。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">......16</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">嗯,外出申請到這裡為止</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">到現在為止已經講很多遍了,我要再講一句.你們要當作是囉唆不聽的話隨你們便。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_61_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_62_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">對於學生們在課堂上學到關於其他世界的事我不再提</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">對於怎麼對付那在外面遊走似人非人的怪物我也不再提</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">還有對於為了其他學生該怎麼做的事我也不再講。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_62_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_63_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">那麼是什麼呢?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">是叫你們不要死</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我以一個老師的身份可以跟學生講的就是這個而已。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_63_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_64_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">.....17</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_65_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這,到底是誰告訴過了呢…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">反正現在這世界維持著本來的精神和形態,就像這些學生一樣帶有特別的要素。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_65_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_66_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"但是學生們到現在還是沒辦法徹底的活用那些要素,真的沒有無法得知到何時才能安全</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">就像學生們入學時也講過的…啊抱歉,這些你們不用聽</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_66_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_67_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我們的學院處處都有特別的結界,但是卻還是在某種程度上會受到異象的影響</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">雖然學院外面有更強,更異常的傢伙在鬧,但能從這些結界開始,學習能力的認證,獲得力量的話,可以說是更強的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_67_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_68_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">.......18</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_69_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我雖一看就知道,但是因為在本館前面就是有一些糊里糊塗的傢伙</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不管怎麼說還是要給學生考考試,我的心理才會感覺比較舒服…。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_69_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">嘖嘖, 到現在還不知道Health Room在哪裡啊...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">從Administration Office出去直走的話，會看到有間寫著[Health Room]的地方，找一下！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_70_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">外面有個叫做 Little Hooligans的傢伙晃來晃去去拿兩個他嘴裡叼的香煙煙蒂來。如果通過考試的話,我就給你們加經驗值和技能點數。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_70_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_71_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">......19q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_72_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">嗯…結界認證已經結束了嗎?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">真的算是很快就結束了呢</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">那裡…喔! 變強哩！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_72_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_73_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">社長用那些奇怪的東西造結界的時候,還半信半疑,原來真的有此驚人效果啊！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_73_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_74_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">....21</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_75_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">但是呢~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">剛開始註冊時就已經講過很多次了,現在外面並非一般市內的面貌是你們無法想像的狀況</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_75_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_76_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">有些才到門口就受傷回到醫護室了,要怎樣做才可以站出正門？所以準備了簡單的能力試驗程式。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_76_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_77_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">正門的終端機將它啟動的話，就開始提出題，要在限制的時間內通過。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_77_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_78_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">......22</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_79_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"不管再怎麼菜,也不能這樣鬼混,這就像是去保持已凋謝的花的美麗是沒用的.像這種程度的考試,就這麼不安</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">學生們怎麼會知道</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">反正給我好好振作!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_79_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">어디서 그런 위험한 약을...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">아니 어쩌면 좋은 일일지도 모르겠군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">'망각의약'... 지금까지 네가 배웠던 모든 것들을 순식간에 잊어버릴 수 있는 약인데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">그동안 조정했던 모든 능력 (스탯)과 기술 (스킬)을 처음 상태로 되돌리게 된다는 걸 명심하고</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">특히 스킬은 문서도 남아있지 않게 되니까 새로 구입하거나 찾아야 한다는 점을 잘 생각해서 선택하도록.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">'망각의약'을 사용한다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_8_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_8_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">그동안 배웠던 모든 능력 (스탯)과 기술 (스킬)을 처음 상태로 되돌린다니</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">그런 위험한 약은 멀리 하라는 게 학원 방침이야!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">하지만 학생은 가지고 있지도 않은 것 같군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">게다가 10개는 있어야 효과가 생기거든</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_8_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_80_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">....23</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_81_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"果然如預想中的一樣</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">學生們要拿著紙幣去給Mystic Peak學院的Student Director來學習意見書。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_81_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_82_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"也許可以給點主意,但是這紙幣不是普通錢幣之類的,不要中途遺失了!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_82_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_83_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">...24q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_84_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">""嗯,原來Mystic Peak的想法也一樣</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">是偽造安神特貨幣的實驗品</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_84_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_85_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"真的很像是那個,有點奇怪,一定要看一下銅板嗎?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_85_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_86_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">......25</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_87_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"啊,不是…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">現在已經沒有必要看內容了,就把東西分別交給教授們就好</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">去把神聖財團本部發出的郵件找出來</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_87_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_88_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">......27</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_89_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"果然跟預想中的一樣</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我說學生們啊…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">現在我們學院的電腦室沒有辦法自動運行,只有給意見書就要求認證實在有點困難?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_89_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">본래는 소승불교에서 모든 번뇌를 뚫고 이치를 깨달아 열반의 경지에 이른 성자를 가리키는 칭호인데 『나한』 이라고도 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">'아라한' 의 자격을 인정받을 수 있다면 특별한 기운이 서린 무기를 받을 수 있어</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">그러려면 '마루치' 와 '아라한' 의 기서를 찾아야만 하지만 말이야...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">'깨달음의 열쇠' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">'나한의 구슬' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_90_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"至少要經過資料的比對之後,才能夠看出程度</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">真要這樣看程度的話,連非常對策書也要寫嗎?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_90_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_91_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我會再聯絡你們,去找Mystic Peak學院的教務主任Student Director,拿恢復電腦室的備用磁片來。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_91_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_92_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">因為很急,就回復一些必要的設施就好,然後把資料找一找。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_92_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_93_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">......28</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_94_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">考慮到你目前的水平，現在，就沒有必要讀取文檔的其餘部分。 把Suggestion book拿過來就好。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_94_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_95_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">....29</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_96_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">음!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">흠, 허허, 이 정도로 여기까지 뛰어 온 건가?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">겨우 7 조각 맞추는 게 뭐 그리 힘들다고...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_96_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">짾??</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_97_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">하기야 문외한이 보면 7조각이라 해도 100 조각은 되는 것처럼 분간이 안될 수도 있긴 하겠지만,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">자 이 부분을 잘 보면 같은 방향으로 찢겨있는 무늬가 살아있지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_97_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">짾??</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_98_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">이게 힌트가 될 수 있지만 여기서 또 하나의 문제가 함정처럼...응? 바로 가져 가려고?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">오랜만에 반가운 걸 가져왔는데 좀 아쉽군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">혹시라도 나중에 비슷한 걸 찾으면 또 가져오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_98_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">?쩊홁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_99_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">....31</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_trick.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">如果你不是一個魔術師, 我沒有什麼能幫你做的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_trick.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">交易</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
