  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">傳達零件</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Physics Teacher的呼叫</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不好意思, 可以幫我從Technical Teacher那邊拿發電機的零件來嗎？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我因為那群瘋狂的勞工而動彈不得,只怕我一離開他們就會將我已做好的工程都被搞砸了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">沒錯! 這就是我之前找的零件</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">真是多謝</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">雖然沒有讓它不再故障的辦法, 不過可以作業好一陣子了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不過這到底是怎麼搞的, 人們會變成那模樣?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">... …..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">本來在旁邊管理工程現在卻躲的遠遠的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">大事不妙~ 工程期限就快到了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">是該做事沒錯, 不過人們變的怪怪的, 機器也故障, 實在麻煩</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問是誰</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">喔, 把這種學生送走吧</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">沒時間沒辦法呀</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Construction Supervisor的請求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">聽聽我的請求</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">為了要在期限內完工,必須要使用機器人來代替瘋掉的工人們,但是現在竟然連發電機都壞掉了.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_workmaster1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
