  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_11_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">事實上不久前清道夫大叔給我這就走了!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">是阿,看起來跟錢沒兩樣,不過仔細看是偽鈔</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">但問題是詢問之後,卻有並非偽鈔的反應出現</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">那紙幣似乎確實有什麼重要的東西</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">現在在路上常會看見有掉落的東西,先撿起來收著吧!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問Leonair Campus的位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">以前明明就在Trading Hole隧道Passage的附近</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">但是某天突然消失不見</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">地圖的紙片真的還在呀</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">搞不好老師也不知道至今還在,真是太好了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">嗯!要不然之前是有要你做的事情啦</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">為了確保學生跟市民最基本的安全是持續整理中沒錯</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">但最近這周圍為非作歹的傢伙變多了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">很好 做的很好</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">往後財團中有補給或支援的時候要你做的事情會很多喔</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">물품 매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">很好，現在您有想起來什麼來了嗎？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">...4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">現在沒辦法拉哩拉雜說一堆,我只告訴你一句話</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">現在周圍幾乎沒有正常的人,千萬不要只因為外表就去接近</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">....10</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">敵人的能力也在變,稍微有變強,要順便消除自負的態度</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">......12</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">而且紙幣周圍反射奇怪的文字，似乎是古代的神秘暗號。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">總之，這些紙幣本身似乎帶有什麼意義，拜託你拿去確定一下。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">阿！這必須由老師保管。拿去給Technical Teacher一張比較好吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">....14</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">而且那個位置阿,從以前就有的東西,像建築物現在卻被侵入的人們佔據</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">雖說異象出現的時機精確的一致</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">什麼 一定就像第一次來這裡的人問的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">朝著Sacred Gate Park，往右邊走是Phoenix Campus，往左邊走的話是Mystic Peak Campus，往後面走是Sacred Gate Campus阿。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">問題不出在那，而是Leonair Campus現在到底在哪裡。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">有人說在Sacred Gate Park的南邊；也有人說在北邊。太混亂了！我想若不直接去確定的話，根本無法得知。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">但是聽說剛好有個叫做Cheng Xi Zhi的射箭部學生,確定了Leonair Campus的位置，還做了張地圖。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不幸地，那地圖卻被怪人搶奪，被撕成一片一片的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">雖然不知道那怪人是誰,重要的是如何找到那被撕成一片片的地圖</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">地圖被撕破的時候，附近有小丑Clown聚集，您覺得這樣的線索是不是足夠我們去破解呢?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">.....15</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">來看看 剩不到七張,怎麼這麼亂阿!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">哎呀!不管老師再怎麼拼湊都不行的吧,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">字太草,圖案也不規則,損傷很嚴重,連接線不確實</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Student Director有做過遺跡挖掘，搞不好可以拼湊的起來。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">....16</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不管怎樣,因為數字不足就這樣放著,往後不知該怎辦</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">即使只有一點點餘力,如能將會造成禍端的東西消失就太好了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">用這樣一臉無知的表情問的話,教你們的老師會很憂鬱的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">哎呀!現在那個老師不知走到多遠去了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">....18</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">恩!! 麻煩你幫我傳達需要接到物品的意見書,如果可以補給的話,就請他將此清單上面的藥品拿給我,謝謝你摟</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_41_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">喔?你的任務是殺死叫做冰法師『Ice Master』的怪物。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我不會給你限制時間，所以您可以放心地慢慢完成任務。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">你打了『Ice Master』？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">哇！我想你不用再害怕寒冷了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">恭喜您過關了！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_43_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">您要去Root Hole嗎？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">那兒能停止時間， 很神奇。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我想空間軸應該是被改變了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我知道財團總社Saint building位在Root Hole。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">希望您也能逛逛。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">득도의 경지에 이른 『마루치』 와 『아라치』 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말인데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">본래는 소승불교에서 모든 번뇌를 뚫고 이치를 깨달아 열반의 경지에 이른 성자를 말이고 『나한』 이라고도 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">'깨달음의 열쇠' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">'나한의 구슬' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_5_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">그 열쇠를 지니고 있다면 재단에 보관중인 걸 받을 수도 있게 된다는 얘기는 들었지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">하지만 지금은 조각조각으로 나뉘어져 있을테니까 일단 7조각을 모으게 되면 나한테 가져오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">아, 그 녹색 구슬 말이지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">그냥 하나씩만으로는 별다를 게 없는데 30개를 다 합쳐서 목걸이를 만들면 꽤 쓸만해 진다지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">OK！讓我想想.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我該怎麼跟您解釋呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問指示</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_8_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問現況</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">啊！聽Construction Supervisor說過了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">你接受我的請托，真是非常感謝。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">希望您能得到所有的支援。加油！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">申請考試</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_9_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
