  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">阿！真的要幫我嗎？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">真是感謝！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我被搶的書是MinFuLeiSi Special Publishing House出版社出的，書名是 "Online Games Programming Guide"。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">剛剛被名叫Cripple Guy 的朋友搶走了。請您幫我找回來好嗎？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
