  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">真的這樣…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這個發生異像的都市啊…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不是啊,如果是之前的事情的話,不是只有一個都市毀滅而已</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">真希望不會發生那樣的事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我該毀了這份差事呢？還是改善它呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">要求修理鑰匙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">天花板坍塌，橋面也斷了......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">窗戶掉了下來......我應該先做些什麼好呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">要求修理鑰匙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問可能需要的幫助</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_1_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">交付 Towel</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_1_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">交付 Glove</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">如果我用太多的力量，它會變形得很嚴重。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">知道如何控制力量是非常重要的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">.....4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">蜘蛛網是最糟糕的部分！還有出現裂縫的牆壁、書桌以及黑板。哎呀！我沒有毛巾和手套！這要我怎麼做事情？！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">嗯~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">請先幫我找來。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我想我的毛巾是放在1樓的 Locker。可以請您幫我拿來嗎？手套的部分，我想我可以自己試試看的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">....5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這意思就是我必須要工作得非常努力。如果我想要順利地進行工作，那就得先拿到毛巾。就是那樣！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">但是，怎麼到現在都還沒找到手套…….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">仔細想想，噢對了！我把它放在Shop House的架子上面了。對吧？請幫我找找，好嗎？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">......6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">您可以走了。我可以自己完成。請把這Crystal交給Student Director，現在我不需要它了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">所以，這個是我們必須先完成的意思嗎？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">嗯，不需要花太多的時間，也不是很難。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">只需要輕輕按一下就可以。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我一個人把學校的設備全部都整頓好了。其實很簡單的，不過，我不知道該從那邊下手。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">噢！我的毛巾。嗯，如果我能擁有一條毛巾的話，我就會工作得更努力的。因為我現在沒有可以擦汗的東西。如果手是滑滑濕濕的，就無法抓住東西。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">手套！我的手套！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">現在我可以開始正常工作了！！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">嗯，從何開始好呢？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">現在我該先做什麼呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">.....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我需要知道如何把這個放在一起…… 絕不能讓這個標識一下子輕按就被彈出來。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">彎曲的地方不要用力。我覺得在反方向的地方，它會變得彎曲.....一定要恢復原形。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">……找我什麼事?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">商店販售</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">掃蕩高利貸 (重複)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">再次搜查</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">消滅高利貸頭目</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">報告結果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">設定開始位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">調查周邊</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">報告調查結果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">制服商人</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">制服商人 (重複)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">調查光爆炸原因</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">傳達成分分析表</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">掃蕩高利貸</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…辛苦了. 他們已經沒有了頭目，應該會自動解散.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…開始調查周邊情況. 你去調查那邊.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…辛苦了.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…商人們…看起來很奇怪. 將他們制服，並帶到這裡.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…我不是很清楚. 你可以去找超能部指導教師來協助調查.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…辛苦了. 這個由我來處理.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…目標已確定. 去消滅高利貸.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…已經處理的差不多了. 放大調查範圍.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…只要消滅頭目，其他人都是烏合之眾. 讓我們去消滅頭目.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">……找我有什麼事?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">商店販售</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">聲東擊西</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">消滅暴力團頭目</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">報告結果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">掃蕩暴力團 (重複)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">設定開始位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">搜查周邊</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">報告調查結果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">搜集情報</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">新情報</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">橋的另一邊</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">報告調查結果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">全力探索</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…找到暴力團頭目的所在地了. 去幫我消滅頭目.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…辛苦你了. 真是幫了我一個大忙.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…消滅剩餘的殘黨.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…看來我們需要確保據點. 能請你幫忙搜查嗎.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…原來如此..? 這地方也是..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…向居民大廳這裡的狀況.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…做得好. 現在到橋的另一邊..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…在橋的另一邊準備開始攻擊. 在這之前先進行偵查.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…與居民說的一樣. 知道了.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…我們先要瞭解敵人的戰力.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…可能比預想的要艱難. 我先潛入進去，你按照作戰計劃進行.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefassassin_2.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefworker.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">好了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">現在可以移動到那邊的隧道了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">路上請小心!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefworker.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不是那邊!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">可不可以在快點?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">哎..呸..幹活又不是一天兩天………嗯? 什麼是?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefworker.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">說明你是調查志願者.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefworker.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">交給整備倉庫鑰匙.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefworker.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">啊, 原來是調查志願者..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">哎…該怎麼辦? 工程還沒完工.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">挖掘機出現了故障，需要零件來修理.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">你可不可以幫我拿回整備倉庫的鑰匙?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefworker.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">接收請求.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefworker.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我忘了以前把鑰匙交給誰保管了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">沒辦法，只能用備用鑰匙了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">去學院廣場找生活指導教師問問.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefworker.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefworker.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">哇~~~太謝謝你了!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">托你的福，可以按時完工了. 呵呵呵.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">再等一會，馬上就要完工了.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_chiefworker.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">啊..啊啊啊..救救我..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">說明不是要害他.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問有關橋的另一邊.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">啊啊..其他人怎麼樣了…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">暴力團肆虐 (重複)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問發生了什麼事.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">啊..啊啊..真, 真的嗎?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">謝, 謝謝你. 非常感謝你.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">好不容易從暴力團逃出來..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">如, 如果再被抓回去，那我就徹底完蛋了.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">異, 異變後有一段時間還是很好的.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">雖然隧道崩塌，但是我還是能自己活下去...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">但是 從不久前開始, 突然出現了一些怪人.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">剛, 剛開始我還以為是小混混</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">他們殺人放火，囚禁居民, 並控制住了這個城市.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">現在還有很多人被他們所奴役，並強制勞動著.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">請幫我們教訓教訓那些壞蛋! 哼哼哼..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">暴力團肆虐</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">啊啊..謝謝你… 非常感謝你.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我, 我擔心目前還被他們所囚禁的人.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">為了其他人也能夠像我一樣逃出來，去教訓教訓那些壞人.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">你, 你說的是橋的另一邊?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">那, 那裡基本上屬於暴力團大本營.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">到處都是手裡拿著槍，頭上蒙著面罩的惡漢..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">而且還有拿著大長刀的可怕的女人們..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">想想也覺得可, 可怕.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_citizen.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">嗨. 你來了.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">商店發售</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">[每日限定] 消失的賬本</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">轉交賬本</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問是不是寫字條的人.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">遞交外賬</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">切斷資金鏈</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">切斷資金鏈 (重複)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">吵鬧的暴走族</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">報告結果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">[每日限定] 幕後黑手</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">무기 부품 전달</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">現在需要管理的事情越來越多. 但是，這幾天由於暴走族每天晚上都鬧的太吵，使得我無法集中精神.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">雖然一般的暴走族我們自己能對付，但是要對付他們的頭目可不簡單.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">請你去幫我教訓教訓他們的頭目.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">非常感謝你.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">現在應該能睡個安穩覺了. 嘻嘻.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這條街大部分已經整理完畢了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這都時拖了你的福. 嘻嘻.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">接下來我想要擴張到武器交易方面..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">你能幫我帶回來一點蒙面人的武器零件嗎?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">非常了不起.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我對你的處理方式很滿意. 嘻嘻.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">那麼，下次再拜託你了.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">哎..現在快忙死了..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">嗯..昨晚有個傢伙偷走了我的賬本?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我大概能猜到是誰幹的..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">幫我教訓那些流氓，並幫我找回賬本.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">謝謝你.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">你, 有沒有興趣一直跟我合作下去?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">….嘻嘻. 開個玩笑.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">明天再見.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">嗯. 是的.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">聽說你前幾天來到了 "東城路".</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">感覺你是個可靠的人，所以我才找你幫忙.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">下一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我先自我介紹.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我是這裡的 Bar "The Blue"的老闆娘. 我叫 "老闆娘 S".</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">「The Blue」是東城路的「暴力團」所掌管的酒吧.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問找我來的理由.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">哎, 你先別急. 嘻嘻</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我之所以找你來，是為了想跟你做一筆交易.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這筆交易肯定對我們彼此都會有所幫助.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">交易?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我雖然隸屬於 "暴力團"..嗯…反正這都無所謂了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我的目的只有一個，就是成為這條街的主人.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">為此我必須要先解決周邊其他的競爭店面..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這也是證明你實力的好機會. 你要幫助我嗎?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">知道了.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">很好.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">那麼第一步，你能先幫我要回一些客人拖欠的外賬嗎.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">如果他們反抗，使用武力也無所謂. 哈哈</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">一張, 兩張, 三張, 四張…….金額無誤. 謝了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">你教訓的那些客人都是些麻煩的傢伙，虧你能這麼快解決.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">證明你還是很有實力的? 哈哈.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">既然已經證明了實力，那我們正式開始談談交易內容吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這裡的大部分商業店面，基本上都屬於「暴力團」的資金鏈.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">如果處理了由他們所掌管的商業店面，對「暴力團」的打擊也是很大的.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">當然, 對我也有處? 哈哈.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">幫我教訓其他店的管理者.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">雖然已經處理了一些，但其數量還是剩很多.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">請繼續幫我處理他們.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_madame.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">探索新事物總是讓人覺得很愉快. 嘻嘻嘻</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">需要我幫忙嗎?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">商店販售</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">[每日限定] 執著地傢伙們</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">轉交藥物樣本</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">說明商人們的狀態</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">請求調查藥物成分</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">煩人的藝術家們</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">煩人的藝術家們 (重複)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">請求檢查狂暴化 II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">獲得成分分析表</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">請求追蹤發信地</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">確認追蹤結果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">已成功追蹤發信地.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">由於是追蹤加密的線路，所以消耗點時間…但是沒問題~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">所有信息都是從那邊的區域傳送過來的.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這幫高利貸就像一群蟑螂!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這次又對商人們使用其他藥物了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">雖然忍術部長給了我藥物樣本，但是數量還是不足.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">需要在找一些樣本過來.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">謝謝你!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">有關分析結果，我會親自報告給忍術部長.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">嗯~你的意思是不分青紅皂白，就像發瘋似的攻過來了?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">就算讓他們鎮定下來，過不久後還是會再次發狂?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">沒有其他別的特殊事項嗎?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">商人們附近一直徘徊著一些奇怪的人們..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">奧..你不覺得很奇怪嗎? 嘻嘻</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">真相永遠只有一個!...應該就是這樣!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">去調查那些人.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">請求檢查狂暴化 I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我就知道會是那樣..拿過來看看.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">目前我的裝備不是很好，檢查結果需要一段時間.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">一個打扮奇怪的人，偷走了我們的補給物資.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">被偷走的物資中，也有以前委託調查的藥物…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">馬上去奪回被偷走的東西!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">上次的那些傢伙，又再次偷走了我們的補給物資.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">馬上去奪回被偷走的東西!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">上一次委託我的成分調查結果已經出來了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">稍等一下~</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">嗯….這裡!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">好像是此成分對商人們的大腦產生了反應，讓他們變得瘋狂.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">你是想讓我追蹤此信息的發信地點?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">稍等一下~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">馬上就好.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_scienceteacher.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">你好~ 我是魔術寵物專門訓練師. 找我有什麼事嗎?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">商店販售</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">僱傭寵物</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">訓練師的委託</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">訓練師的委託 (重複)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">無法捨棄的依戀</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">無法找到特殊的方法</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">[每日限定] 變異的線索</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">轉交變異之核</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">其他搜查組好像發現了能夠隨意馴服它們的人.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">或者..能幫我找到那個人並詢問馴服動物的方法嗎?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">是嗎..?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…我真的該放棄了嗎?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">喂，說你呢~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">難道你對那些動物突然變異不覺得好奇嗎?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我好像在死掉的動物身上看到了奇怪的核. 我對此感到非常的好奇.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">你能幫我找點變異之核過來嗎?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">謝謝你~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">調查這些東西，應該能找到點線索.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">那麼，下次再拜託你了~!!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">如果想要僱傭魔術寵物，需要優先學習寵物魔術學. 你是否學過寵物魔術?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">是的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">不是</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">很遺憾，你還沒有學習寵物魔術學. 如果有興趣你可以試著學一學.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我先給你簡單說明一下有關寵物魔術學.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">你所僱傭的戰鬥寵物，隨著你自身的能力值的強化，它們也將會變得更強大. 而且可以通過指令技能，在適當的場合命令戰鬥寵物使用它們獨有的四種技能. 而且每隻戰鬥寵物都很可愛哦. 那麼~現在讓我們看看每隻戰鬥寵物的特徵吧?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問有關老虎.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問有關花貓.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_4_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">詢問有關貓頭鷹.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">魔術寵物 老虎</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">指令1. 1.5秒內 拉近目標, 移動速度 -30%, HP吸收 +10%</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">指令2. 1.5秒內 移動速度 -20%, HP吸收 +10%,, 技能射程 -70</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">指令3. 1.5秒內 迅速接近目標, HP吸收 +10%,, 固定目標, 禁用藥水</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">指令4. 0.8秒內 昏厥, HP吸收 +10%, 防禦力 -10%</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">寵物具有攻擊型技能.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">是不是很想與老虎一起冒險呢??</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">僱傭老虎.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">魔術寵物 花貓</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">指令1. 1.5秒內 每秒+100, 移除debuff效果, 防止狀態異常/恢復</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">指令2. 1.5秒內 吸收物理傷害+10%, 防禦力+5%, HP+MP+SP恢復率0.01%</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">指令3. 2秒內 攻擊力 +15%, 命中率 +30</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">指令4. 1秒內 吸收魔法傷害+10%, HP恢復率 +0.2%, 抗性+20, 攻擊速度+20%, 移動速度+20%</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">寵物具有buff型技能.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">是不是很想與花貓一起冒險呢?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">僱傭花貓.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">魔術寵物 貓頭鷹</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">指令1. 2秒內 防禦-10%, 攻擊速度 -20%, HP吸收 +10%,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">指令2. 2秒內 防禦-10%, 技能延遲+10%, HP吸收 +10%</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">指令3. 1.5秒內 防禦-30%, 命中 -45, 攻擊力 -30%, HP吸收 +10%,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">指令4. 0.8秒內 防禦-10%, 禁用技能, 禁用藥水, HP吸收 +10%</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">寵物具有debuff型技能.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">是不是很想與貓頭鷹一起冒險呢?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">僱傭貓頭鷹.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_7_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">請問...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">在附近遭到動物們攻擊的人是你吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我想要訓練它們.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">你能幫助我嗎?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">幫我捕獲各10只動物過來~</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我作為動物專家受到了很大的打擊.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">如果無法馴服也就沒辦法了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">幫我消滅它們.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_hl_tricker_animal.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_industry_helper1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我專門提供藥物給學生。有什麼需要我幫忙的，請儘管說，不用客氣。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_industry_helper1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">物品交易</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_industry_helper1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">設為起點位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_industry_helper2.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">好久沒見到人類了。有什麼問題，請儘管來找我。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_industry_helper2.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">物品交易</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_infinitystairs.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">先做好完全準備，否則您會後悔的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_infinitystairs.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">物品販售</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">嘿，新生！你屬於哪部門的？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我會給你你部門裡使用的武器。告訴我，你是終極部的也可以使用它。但是，武器將只提供給學生誰達到10級以上的人。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">當你達到30級，50級和70級時，我會再給您換個更好的武器，別忘了來拿你的武器。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">劍道部新成員向大家招呼！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">申請新手武器</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">新忍術部成員進行禮貌的招呼</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">作為一個魔術部的新成員有禮貌的打招呼.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我會給你，你的圈子使用的武器。告訴我，你是屬於！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">弓箭部新成員向大家招呼！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">至尊級的也可以使用它。然而，武器將只提供給學生誰達到10級後，我會當你達到30級，50和70，因此換到一個更好的武器，別忘了來拿你的武器。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">新超能部成員進行禮貌的招呼</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">告訴他，您是終極部的劍道高手。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">告訴他，您是終極部的格鬥高手。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">告訴他，您是終極部的弓箭高手。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">告訴他，您是終極部的氣功高手。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">新生的等級需為30級或30級以上，才能得到合適的武器唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我想要適合我的劍道部專用武器。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我想要適合我的格鬥部專用武器。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我想要適合我的弓箭部專用武器。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我想要適合我的氣功部專用武器。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我想要適合我的超能部專用武器。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_1_6">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我想要適合我的忍術部專用武器。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_1_7">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我想要一個適合我的魔術師的武器.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">您是新生嗎？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">聽取他的故事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">能夠喚醒世界的沉睡，並超越時空間的強大咒語時氣功部最終的研磨目標。氣功部的基本功就從『棒子』開始練起吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">領取一般型 'Staff'</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_11_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我可以看到你已經變得更強大了，很快就會需要新的武器。一旦你到達30，50和70級時，請回到我身邊來交換你的武器。另外，退還或更換是不可以的。知道嗎？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 Lv. 30 'Staff'</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_12_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 Lv. 50 'Staff'</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_12_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 power type spear.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_12_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 spirit type staff.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_12_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換敏捷類型的Lance.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_12_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">超能部用槍是為了要迅速壓制敵人。您要哪種武器呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">槍支-敏捷型</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_14_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">槍支-力量型</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_14_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">槍支-精神型</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_14_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我可以看到你已經變得更強大了，很快就會需要新的武器。一旦你到達30，50和70級時，請回到我身邊來交換你的武器。另外，退還或更換是不可以的。知道嗎？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 Lv. 30 Dex type weapon.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_15_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_15_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 Lv. 30 Power type weapon.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_15_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 Lv. 30 Spirit type weapon.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_15_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 Lv. 50 Dex type weapon.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_15_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 Lv. 50 Power type weapon.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_15_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 Lv. 50 Spirit type weapon.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_15_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 Lv. 70 Dex type weapon.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_15_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 Lv. 70 Power type weapon.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_15_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 Lv. 70 Spirit type weapon.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">通常新生練到10級就可以來找我領取武器。尚未符合資格的學生請繼續加油喲。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">你還沒有達到10級。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="tw">這是一塊蛋糕，成為10級後，我會給你一個不錯的武器作為禮物。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">…….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">劍術是一個非常高的智力研究領域，可培養一個人的身體和精神。你想使用哪個武器？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">'Sword' 敏捷型</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">'Blade' 力量型</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_2_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">'Vital Sword' 精神型</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_2_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">忍術部是利用固定石力量和自古流傳下來的法術，在任何情況下都可以制服敵人的超強人氣職業。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">敏捷型 "Dual Spear"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_20_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">力量型 "Scythe"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_20_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">精神型 "Shuriken"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_20_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">我可以看到你已經變得更強大了，很快就會需要新的武器。一旦你到達30，50和70級時，請回到我身邊來交換你的武器。另外，退還或更換是不可以的。知道嗎？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 30 Lv. "Dual Spear"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_21_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">回主題</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_21_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 30 Lv. "Scythe"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_21_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 30 Lv. "Shuriken"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_21_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 50 Lv. "Dual Spear"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_21_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 50 Lv. "Scythe"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_21_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 50 Lv. "Shuriken"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_21_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 70 Lv. "Dual Spear"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_21_0_8">
