  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_23_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">上一頁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">當你的等級到達了30, 50, 70級的時候再來找我,就能幫你把現有的武器換成更強大的.找我對話的時候不要忘了把你的武器從裝備欄裡卸下來,放在背包了哦. ^__^</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="tw">換取 30級 Cube</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
